<!--

  Template MJML — Notification interne (équipe HFE) — nouveau message formulaire contact

  PAS l'accusé de réception visiteur : utiliser contact-confirmation-visiteur-mailjet.mjml pour l'émetteur.



  À compiler : npx mjml emails/contact-notification-mailjet.mjml -o emails/contact-notification-mailjet.html



  Champs : src/components/ContactForm.tsx — public/contact-zapier.php — contact-zapier-payload-keys.json

  Variables : {{var:name}}, {{var:email}}, …

-->

<mjml>

  <mj-head>

    <mj-title>Nouveau message — Contact Hecker &amp; Frères Énergie (HFE)</mj-title>

    <mj-preview>Un visiteur a envoyé une demande depuis le formulaire de contact du site hfe-energie.fr.</mj-preview>

    <mj-attributes>

      <mj-all font-family="Inter, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />

      <mj-text color="#1e293b" font-size="16px" line-height="24px" />

      <mj-button

        background-color="#00B040"

        color="#ffffff"

        font-size="16px"

        font-weight="600"

        border-radius="12px"

        inner-padding="14px 28px"

      />

    </mj-attributes>

  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#f8fafc" width="600px">

    <mj-section background-color="#0f172a" padding="28px 40px 20px">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-image

          src="https://hfe-energie.fr/assets/logo/hfe-sansFond.png"

          alt="Hecker &amp; Frères Énergie (HFE)"

          width="130px"

          padding="14px 24px"

          container-background-color="#ffffff"

          border-radius="12px"

          href="https://hfe-energie.fr/"

        />

        <mj-text

          align="center"

          font-size="13px"

          font-weight="700"

          letter-spacing="0.06em"

          text-transform="uppercase"

          color="#99e1ab"

          padding="12px 0 0"

          line-height="20px"

        >

          Chauffagiste · Climaticien · RGE QualiPAC

        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>



    <mj-section padding="0" background-color="#0f172a">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-divider border-width="3px" border-color="#00B040" padding="0" />

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>



    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="32px 40px 16px">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-text font-size="20px" font-weight="700" color="#0080C0" padding-bottom="8px">

          Nouvelle demande depuis le site

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#475569" padding-bottom="0">

          Formulaire de contact — pompe à chaleur, climatisation, chauffage, chauffe-eau thermodynamique,

          plomberie ou dépannage. Répondre au contact ci-dessous sous 72 h ouvrées.

        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>



    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px 8px">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-text font-size="15px" font-weight="700" color="#0080C0" padding-bottom="12px">

          Contenu du formulaire

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-bottom="12px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">Vous êtes</strong><br />

          {{var:client_type_label}}

          <span style="color: #64748b; font-size: 13px;"> ({{var:client_type}})</span>

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-bottom="12px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">Nom &amp; prénom</strong><br />

          {{var:name}}

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-bottom="12px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">E-mail</strong><br />

          <a href="mailto:{{var:email}}" style="color: #009638; font-weight: 600;">{{var:email}}</a>

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-bottom="12px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">Téléphone</strong><br />

          <a href="tel:{{var:phone_raw}}" style="color: #009638; font-weight: 600;">{{var:phone}}</a>

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-bottom="12px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">Code postal</strong><br />

          {{var:postal}}

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding-bottom="12px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">Type de projet</strong><br />

          {{var:service_label}}

          <span style="color: #64748b; font-size: 13px;"> ({{var:service}})</span>

        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>



    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px 24px">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-text padding-bottom="8px">

          <strong style="color: #0080C0">Votre projet</strong>

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text padding="12px 16px" container-background-color="#f8fafc" color="#1e293b">

          {{var:message}}

        </mj-text>

        <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#64748b" padding-top="14px" padding-bottom="0">

          Source : {{var:source}} — Page d'envoi : {{var:page}}

        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>



    <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 40px 32px">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-button href="mailto:{{var:email}}" align="left">Répondre par e-mail</mj-button>

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>



    <mj-section background-color="#e6f4fb" padding="24px 40px">

      <mj-column width="100%">

        <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#475569" align="center" padding="0">

          E-mail automatique — notification interne Hecker &amp; Frères Énergie (HFE).<br />

          Installateur RGE QualiPAC · Lille et métropole lilloise.<br /><br />

          <span style="color: #64748b;">

            Consentement formulaire (horodatage) : {{var:privacy_policy_accepted_at}}<br />

            Reçu le : {{var:submitted_at}}

          </span>

        </mj-text>

      </mj-column>

    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>

</mjml>

